# "Planeswalkers you control" is the planeswalkers of Tomik's controller, so an opponent's planeswalker is not capped:
# Bot1 controls Tomik and attacks Bot2's Ashiok, Dream Render with two creatures in one declaration (CR 508.1c). Tomik is
# cast on turn 3 with the moxen untapped again, so it is on the battlefield as the attackers are declared. Ashiok takes
# 2 + 1 and is left at 2 loyalty; Bot2 is untouched.

